OL,3,GNEWSA#9m spent on road widening scheme
OL,4,Awith no start date
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, a DfI spokesperson said
OL,7,Fthe A2 Buncrana Road is "a key
OL,8,Fstrategic route" in the north west and
OL,9,F"an important link between Derry and
OL,10,FCounty Donegal" that "remains under
OL,11,Fconsideration as part of the North West
OL,12,FTransport Plan 2035".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
